      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200201502/2002015020010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015020020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "わざわざ迎えに来てくださってありがとうございます\r\n大丈夫だったのに",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201502/2002015020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "自分の体が空いてるのに\r\n仕事を頑張ってるアイドルのこと放っておくわけないだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015020030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……そういうところ、本当に律儀ですよね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201502/2002015020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015020040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "忙しいかどうかなんて\r\n言わなければわからないのに",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201502/2002015020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それはお互い様だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今日の仕事はどうだった？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015020050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "滞りなく\r\n特に困ったこともありませんでしたし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201502/2002015020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015020060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ、でも『もう年末だね』という話はしました",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201502/2002015020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この時期はどこでもそういう話になるよなぁ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015020070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい、そろそろ年内にお会いするのは最後、\r\nという方も出てきますしね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201502/2002015020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002015020080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "早いなぁと思います……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200201502/2002015020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、あっという間だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
